-- The lawn under Noke's Tower (the book's map of the tower: the two pages side by side, Conner's November 6
-- call), redrawn in our pieces. North is up, as the map has it: the two huts on the west, the outhouse to
-- the south, the four oaks in the middle with the platforms above them, and the ramp up to the garden
-- platform in the east. The party comes in up the path from the south-west.

